          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "गंध (gandh) is inherited: CDIAL lists Hindi gandh, \"smell\", under Sanskrit gandhá, \"smell\" (CDIAL 4014). It can be pleasant or not; khuśbū is only a good smell."
