          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "महक (mahak) is a tadbhava: CDIAL lists Hindi mahak, \"fragrance\", under Sanskrit magha, which it glosses as a fragrance and the name of a flower (CDIAL 9703). It is a strong, spreading smell, usually a pleasant one."
